{
  "_comment": [
    "#378 drift gate. ONE fixture, both ports. There is no codegen between",
    "Grappa.Push.Payload / Grappa.UserSettings and their TypeScript mirrors",
    "(scripts/check.sh's gen_wire_types --check covers wireTypes.ts only, and",
    "notification_prefs passes through UserSettingsJSON as an opaque map), so",
    "this file is the enforcement.",
    "",
    "ExUnit (test/grappa/push/push_parity_test.exs) asserts the SERVER",
    "produces exactly these shapes. vitest (src/lib/pushParity.test.ts)",
    "asserts the CLIENT accepts them and that DEFAULT_NOTIFICATION_PREFS",
    "matches. Change either side -> one suite goes red -> update this file ->",
    "the other suite picks it up. Same discipline as",
    "shouldNotifyTruthTable.json.",
    "",
    "A hand-copied literal in a vitest test would NOT be a gate: if the",
    "Elixir builder changed, the literal would not move and both suites would",
    "stay green."
  ],

  "notification_prefs_defaults": {
    "channel_messages_all": false,
    "channel_messages_only": [],
    "channel_mentions": true,
    "private_messages_all": true,
    "private_messages_only": [],
    "presence_online": false,
    "presence_offline": false
  },

  "presence_payloads": [
    {
      "why": "plain online transition",
      "nick": "alice",
      "presence": "online",
      "network_slug": "azzurra",
      "payload": {
        "title": "alice is online",
        "body": "on azzurra",
        "tag": "azzurra:presence:alice",
        "url": "/?network=azzurra&channel=alice"
      },
      "expect_target": { "kind": "query", "channelName": "alice" }
    },
    {
      "why": "offline direction",
      "nick": "alice",
      "presence": "offline",
      "network_slug": "azzurra",
      "payload": {
        "title": "alice is offline",
        "body": "on azzurra",
        "tag": "azzurra:presence:alice",
        "url": "/?network=azzurra&channel=alice"
      },
      "expect_target": { "kind": "query", "channelName": "alice" }
    },
    {
      "why": "title keeps upstream casing, tag folds it (#121)",
      "nick": "Alice",
      "presence": "online",
      "network_slug": "azzurra",
      "payload": {
        "title": "Alice is online",
        "body": "on azzurra",
        "tag": "azzurra:presence:alice",
        "url": "/?network=azzurra&channel=Alice"
      },
      "expect_target": { "kind": "query", "channelName": "Alice" }
    },
    {
      "why": "rfc1459 bracket fold in the tag — alice[m] and alice{m} are one identity",
      "nick": "alice[m]",
      "presence": "online",
      "network_slug": "azzurra",
      "payload": {
        "title": "alice[m] is online",
        "body": "on azzurra",
        "tag": "azzurra:presence:alice{m}",
        "url": "/?network=azzurra&channel=alice%5Bm%5D"
      },
      "expect_target": { "kind": "query", "channelName": "alice[m]" }
    },
    {
      "why": "non-ASCII nick percent-encodes in the deep link",
      "nick": "café",
      "presence": "online",
      "network_slug": "azzurra",
      "payload": {
        "title": "café is online",
        "body": "on azzurra",
        "tag": "azzurra:presence:café",
        "url": "/?network=azzurra&channel=caf%C3%A9"
      },
      "expect_target": { "kind": "query", "channelName": "café" }
    }
  ]
}
